    // §12.1's main roof is a HIP: `roof_geometry.roof_planes` builds four planes that meet at a
    // ridge, and a hip roof has no gable end to put a louvre in. Measured by `HOUSE-00496`'s rule
    // the day it was written, both stood **1.44 m inside solid roof** -- a 0.80 m opening whose
    // sill is +11.30 in a wall the hip crosses at +10.57.
